window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>One of five knights trapped in a magical realm for centuries, Gavin Campbell, has endured unrelenting torment for hundreds of years. Now, he's determined to break free—not only for himself but for his fellow knights who share his fate. But the spell that binds them can only be shattered by a challenge unlike any Gavin has ever faced.</p> <p>Sabrina Lockhart is used to photographing the world's most alluring men, yet nothing prepares her for Gavin. Haunted, fierce, and devastatingly handsome, he ignites a spark she can't ignore. But as she fights to uncover the vulnerability behind his impenetrable shield, she realizes that unlocking his heart may be her only hope to set him free.</p> <p>Liam Murray, once in love with Gavin, now harbors a festering grudge born from heartbreak. A chance at freedom, brings with it an attractive man who stirs forgotten feelings, Liam must decide if he can risk opening his heart again—or if his past wounds will keep him bound to his cursed fate.</p> <p>Thrown into a dangerous race against time and their own deepest fears, Sabrina, Gavin, and Liam must confront the mysteries of the past—and the connections that may hold the key to their freedom.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
